{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":92,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":92,"text":"  the client's data is sampled, from devices, and arrives late","end":"\n"}
{"stream":"eml","proto":"eml-trace-v1","seq":93,"ts":"1970-01-01T00:00:00.000Z","type":"eml:output","mono":93,"text":"  so the better-instrumented side wins the argument, and it is the side","end":"\n"}
